 CellLabel->
  "In[1500]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5d60b9a9-3056-45c7-97b0-5efa8fe1d714"],

Cell["\<\
We can see from the above plot that the reproductive rate is slightly higher \
than the diffusion rate.  For these specific values the algae bloom will not \
die out.

However, what is the long-term behavior?  Consider extending the solution to \
much later in time.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2fc014fe-3597-4277-b570-7f1ef32815eb"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"tStop", " ", "=", " ", "3000"}], ";"}]], "InputOnly",
 CellLabel->
  "In[1501]:=",ExpressionUUID->"7b80c3f7-25dc-4beb-b1bb-5bf31bf3d68b"],

